message.content:
先使用 `get_zipcode_based_on_city` 函数获取旧金山和 Rivermist 的邮编，然后调用 `estimate_distance` 来计算两地之间的距离。接下来，使用 `estimate_drive_feasibility_by_mileage` 判断在当前油量下这段行程是否可行。以下是实现步骤：

```json
{
  "name": "get_zipcode_based_on_city",
  "arguments": {
    "city": "San Francisco"
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "name": "get_zipcode_based_on_city",
  "arguments": {
    "city": "Rivermist"
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "name": "estimate_distance",
  "arguments": {
    "cityA": "<旧金山邮编>",
    "cityB": "<Rivermist邮编>"
  }
}
```

```json
{
  "name": "estimate_drive_feasibility_by_mileage",
  "arguments": {
    "distance": <估计距离>
  }
}
```

请先执行上述函数以获取所需信息。

